   "do": [
    {
     "sfx": "paper"
    },
    {
     "journal": [
      "pike_log",
      "Keeper's log",
      "Asa Pike's log. Most of it is weather. The last entries, the hand getting worse:\n\n\"Sept 28. RAIN. 48 deg. Wind SW. Stayed in.\"\n\n\"Oct 3. CHANGE. 55 deg. Wind W. Mended the boat.\"\n\n\"Oct 9. FAIR. 63 deg. Wind NE. Rowed out to the reef. Last good day on the water I'll have.\"\n\n\"Oct 12. STORM. 41 deg. Wind E. Lamp failed at midnight.\"\n\n\"Locker key is kept where the weather lives. Set the station to my last good day on the water and tap the glass.\"\n\n\"Locker bars are Pa's design. Each one pinned by the one beneath it.\"\n\n\"The tin with the hatch key opens to the Light's own character. Any keeper knows it by heart.\"\n\n\"Painted the Hook over the lamp so we'd never lose the order of it.\"\n\n\"Lit her at three bells. The beam went to sea and something out there TURNED. I covered her and tied the cloth off to the roof. I have locked the stair. I am not going down there again.\""
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": "The keeper's log. It's in your journal."
    }
   ]
  },
